  "notes": [
    "Maximums and minimums are per 1,000 points unless otherwise stated.",
    "The Old and Middle Guard formed their own Division of the Hundred Days campaign; each brigade fields two battalions of either Old or Middle Guard, but not mixed.",
    "0 to 1 Marines of the Guard battalion (Tiny) may substitute for the Small version if desired.",
    "Allies: up to 25% of points may be spent on the French Army of the North Corps list; any minimums from that list apply to the points spent here (e.g. taking a Guard Heavy Cavalry Brigade needs three Corps infantry brigades first).",
    "This builder omits the book's many point-modifier upgrades/downgrades (Valiant upgrade, Large regiments, etc.) — apply these manually per the book when finalising a list."
